# Permanent redirects.
#
# The admissions modules were flattened in the first release
# (/pathways, /china, /requirements) and were reorganised into a single
# admissions section with sub-paths. These 301s keep any link that was already
# shared working, and pass the ranking signal to the new URL.
#
# Reference: https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/

/pathways                      /admissions/pathways          301!
/china                         /admissions/mainland          301!
/requirements                  /admissions/requirements      301!

/en/pathways                   /en/admissions/pathways       301!
/en/china                      /en/admissions/mainland       301!
/en/requirements               /en/admissions/requirements   301!
